 "remarks": "Perfect 4 Bedroom three bathroom Home with In-Law Suite! fully renovated, home offers the perfect blend of comfort, style, and flexibility. the property features a total of 6 bedrooms, 3 full bathrooms, and 1 half bath, including a private in-law suite-ideal for extended family or multi-generational living. Or extra income.  The main residence features 4 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms, including a desirable first-floor master suite for added convenience. Bright and inviting living spaces flow seamlessly into a beautifully updated kitchen complete with stainless steel appliances, abundant cabinetry, and a large center island-perfect for everyday living and entertaining.  The 2-bedroom, 1-bath in-law suite offers additional privacy and versatility, making it ideal for guests, extended family Enjoy plenty of storage throughout, generous closet space, central air with a 2-zone system, a 1-car garage, and two driveways providing ample parking. The private backyard with patio space offers a great setting for relaxing, entertaining, or enjoying outdoor living.  Conveniently located in a desirable area  A rare move-in ready opportunity offering space, functionality, and modern updates throughout.",
